  - question: "Who is Appwrite Start for?"
    answer: "Appwrite Start is for developers and small teams who need more than the Free tier for a live app but are not ready for Pro. Typical fits include side projects going to production, early MVPs, client work with modest traffic, and student or indie products that still need daily backups and email support."
