    answer: "They solve different problems. The [Startups program](/startups) offers credits and hands-on support for qualifying early-stage companies. Appwrite Start is a standard Cloud subscription eligible organizations can choose on the [pricing page](/pricing), with included resources and predictable monthly pricing. You do not apply for Appwrite Start the way you apply for Startups."
